			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761830101,
					"content": "感谢你的邀请，桑多涅。茶点也依旧是熟悉的味道，令人怀念。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830102,
					"content": "别客气。喜欢的话，在至冬我们也像以前一样多聚聚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830103,
					"content": "那是自然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830104,
					"content": "说到至冬，你那边一切都还顺利吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830105,
					"content": "嗯，女皇陛下的谋划有了初步进展，但「严冬计划」的执行比市长大人想象中要困难得多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830106,
					"content": "这么说你我之后都要忙起来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830107,
					"content": "但偶尔出来喝杯茶，或是去科洛列夫茨基剧团看场表演的时间或许还是有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830124,
					"content": "嗯，偶尔出来喝杯茶，或是去科洛列夫茨基剧团看场表演的时间或许还是有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830108,
					"content": "奥黛塔还在跳芭蕾吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830109,
					"content": "嗯，一段时间不见，她的技术就又有精进了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830110,
					"content": "真好啊，等回去了我也想去看一场。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830111,
					"content": "有时候看她会觉得很奇妙。明明是罗莎琳教出来的，但性格作风却和罗莎琳完全不一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830112,
					"content": "这也不一定就是坏事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830113,
					"content": "嗯…如果说罗莎琳让人感觉像热烈的火，那奥黛塔就像坚实的冰。看不透的那种冰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830114,
					"content": "她似乎背负了很多东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830115,
					"content": "是啊，但她在台上表演时，舞步又是如此纯净，仿佛心中没有一丝杂质。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830116,
					"content": "或是将它们封到了人们看不见的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830117,
					"content": "嗯。说到底还是像冰，但一点也不脆弱。坚实的冰。硬要说还是很危险那种。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830118,
					"content": "这点又和罗莎琳挺像。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830119,
					"content": "危险的方面？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830120,
					"content": "坚定的方面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830121,
					"content": "也对。难怪说她是目前最有希望继承「女士」这一头衔的愚人众。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830122,
					"content": "哈…若是未来和她关系再近一些，就邀请她来参加我们的茶会吧。希望她不会拒绝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830123,
					"content": "但愿如此吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				}
			]
		},
